      "text": "I wish you guys would stop telling the lie that Ethiopia was never colonized. What do you think Emperor Menelik II was doing? He was forcing non-Amhara peoples into an imperial state that became  Ethiopia as we see it on the map today! I talk to Oromo people all the time who tell me the horror stories of how Emperor Menelok brutally destroyed their independence beginning in the middle of the 19th century to force them into the Ethiopian empire! That's imperialism! That's colonialism, Ethiopian style!",
      "likeCount": 1,
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-26T09:34:39Z",
      "replyCount": 0,
      "replies": []
    },
